+*   **Inputs:** A single blurry LDR RGB image $\mathcal{I}_{LDR}$, corresponding event data $B$, camera poses $p(t)$, and exposure time $\Delta t_{exp}$.
+*   **Outputs:** Sharp HDR novel view images and LDR images at arbitrary exposures.
 
 **Data Structures:**
-*   **NeRF Network ($F_\theta$):** A multi-layer perceptron (MLP) with parameters $\theta$. It takes positional encoded 3D position $\mathbf{o}$ and viewing direction $\mathbf{d}$ as input.
